00:25:18.440 --> 00:25:20.320
So the way we have developed our brain

00:25:20.320 --> 00:25:24.040
computer interface is we are collecting
brain signals, for example,

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:27.080
alpha or beta or gamma,
