00:25:59.920 --> 00:26:03.920
The mind controlled video games are
proving to be an efficient treatment

00:26:03.960 --> 00:26:08.320
for diseases like depression or
hyperactivity disorder in children.

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:15.120
At Neuroscape a neuro-technological
company based in San Francisco,

00:26:15.160 --> 00:26:17.280
they are using these video games

00:26:17.320 --> 00:26:21.560
controlled by the mind
for therapeutic uses.

00:26:24.680 --> 00:26:28.040
All of our research right
now relies on using

00:26:28.080 --> 00:26:31.600
a closer video games
that we've created so far,

00:26:31.640 --> 00:26:34.480
just using the performance,
not the cognitive brain computer interface

00:26:34.520 --> 00:26:37.520
that's still very much
in the research phase.

00:26:37.560 --> 00:26:39.840
And then we apply these

00:26:39.880 --> 00:26:43.680
closed loop video game treatments to see
if they can improve attention abilities

00:26:43.720 --> 00:26:48.440
in many different clinical
populations, including ADHD,

00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:52.560
which is attention deficit hyperactivity
disorder, but also post-traumatic stress

00:26:52.560 --> 00:26:56.360
disorder, traumatic brain injury,
depression and autism.

00:26:56.400 --> 00:27:00.760
We developed these closed loop video games
that record your performance and use

00:27:00.800 --> 00:27:04.360
that data to challenge you
in a very personalized manner.

00:27:04.400 --> 00:27:07.400
So, if it's too hard,
the game could back off.

00:27:07.440 --> 00:27:09.200
If it's too easy, it can
