00:27:09.200 --> 00:27:11.080
It just puts it right at that sweet spot,

00:27:11.120 --> 00:27:13.280
and then the game mechanics target

00:27:13.320 --> 00:27:15.920
different neural networks
that we're trying to improve.

00:27:15.960 --> 00:27:19.880
So, it could be a prescribable treatment,
just like we currently use stimulants

00:27:19.920 --> 00:27:24.200
to help improve attention abilities
in children that are suffering ADHD.

