so what we do is we're a platform

00:29:01.680 --> 00:29:06.440
that allows us to interface
directly with the brain.

00:29:06.480 --> 00:29:09.800
Today it's using noninvasive methods.

00:29:09.840 --> 00:29:12.360
So we start from the sensor input.

00:29:12.400 --> 00:29:15.120
So measuring the brain activity itself

00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:19.480
through to the translation
of the electrical signals from the brain

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:24.800
